00:56:43.720 --> 00:56:51.420
<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia, who wanders into the studio while we are on the air, hands full of snacks.

00:56:51.420 --> 00:56:55.520
<v Julia>All y'all are putting on a big show. Y'all want some popcorn?

00:56:55.520 --> 00:56:59.980
